<p class="section__intro">Save these numbers in your phone before you need them. In a life-threatening emergency, always call 999 first.</p>

<div class="alert-box alert-box--danger">
  <p class="alert-box__heading">Life-threatening emergency? Call 999.</p>
  <p>999 connects you to Police, Fire and Ambulance services in Gibraltar. If in immediate danger, call 999 first.</p>
</div>

